links":[["Pine County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/minnesota/pine-county"],["ARC or PLC in Pine County","/arc-plc/minnesota/pine-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Pine County runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 14 grids, September to October, October to November and November to December each came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids got 56% of normal in September to October and 39% in October to November. Grid 30748 had its driest year in 1976 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
